{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於佛得不壞淨，寧捨身命，終不歸于\n外道天神。於法得不壞淨，假使以邪法竄入正法，能辨其邪；假使以正法混入邪法，能識其正，終不依于\n外道典籍。於僧得不壞淨，見勝義及清淨僧，恭敬親近；見啞羊及無慚僧，憐愍攝護，不生憍慢及退墮心，\n終不依于外道邪眾。於戒得不壞淨，寧捨身命，終不毀犯所受諸佛淨戒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "而無\n奈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "我本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼上座等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "而來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "我實睡眠不知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "使其"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不禮不答，皆悉不犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誤故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "令捨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此指菩薩比丘，既為出家\n人，便應同出家法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦須"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "而"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸比丘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自他兼利之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "豈可反不學此比丘戒耶？此則應同，不同為有罪也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "單"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雖為比丘，亦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所以"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "可謂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是為一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼居士等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "衣但"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不拘多少，堪則"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是為二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是為三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦如\n是，是為四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是為五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為眾生故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是為六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聲聞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "既已"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "便應"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此則不應同，而同為有罪也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○\n慊，謙上聲，與歉同，恨也。若作入聲讀之，則是快足之義，非今文意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悲敬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "犯盜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "橫生誹謗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不除滅者，是名不犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "厭下苦粗障，欣上淨妙離"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "復"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "失"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛經深"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已曾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "決不為外學所\n動"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勝時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "劣時旁涉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離許一分劣時旁涉外典，若復"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隨書生見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不知愛見二論過患"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皆悉犯也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雖或"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能即"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於此甚深義，勉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心而"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應自責言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具足十力"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上根眾生，而作此第一義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦復更"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以逗\n我等淺機之人。然則若深若淺，皆是佛說，皆是慧眼應機之法。我今"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妄自"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若能如是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "知退"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "于"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "而于"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "現"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念而"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信趣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "而便起"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故不犯也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此中兼明不看貧苦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "看他"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有犯不犯，看他"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有犯不犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為正說必"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為正說必"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼與我總"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說必不受。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不可與語。○𢤱，力董切，不調也。又平聲，多惡也。又去聲，性恨也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所謂不以"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所以不說、不讚、不犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "而原"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "而原"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所以不說、不讚、不犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所以\n不說、不讚、不犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方乃讚歎、唱善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "而"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "而"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "而"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故置不訶責、折伏、罰黜，所謂默擯法門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然後訶責、折伏、\n罰黜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故不訶責、折伏、罰黜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故不須訶責等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "既已"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "則于"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "設見神力則必"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或令"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故不恐怖引接"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見神力則必"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼由\n神力而"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故不恐怖引接，不犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "便是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "便是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T24n1500_p1109a13"}
{"id": null, "n": "0180a1001", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0180a1001", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
